# Actor kind $50 ($83:D109, its wait $83:D1B0), placed only in level 0
# (level1.state) at x $07D8-$08D8, where no other script goes: it rises
# out of the ground in steps, waits, sinks, and again, facing Aladdin. The
# view put at x $0700 and Aladdin at x $0780, so the first two (records
# $0C9B, $0CEB) are placed; each restarted once (state $0C) a frame apart
# from the other, so their starts draw RandomNext both ways ($20 and $40
# frames up), and both run a whole cycle (up, wait, down). Then Aladdin
# between them at x $0800 throws apples left (the count kept at 6): those
# reaching one down it (its wait's ActorDownedByShot, $83:D1BC).
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 00,07
poke 0019E5 00,07
poke 0008E7 80,07
poke 0008EA 80,01
wait 60
poke 000CEB 0C
wait 61
poke 000C9B 0C
wait 300
repeat 15
poke 000369 06
poke 0008E7 00,08
hold LEFT+A 1
wait 7
end
wait 120
